<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian forces are preparing to send troops to Saudi Arabia to support the war against the Houthis, while publicly denying any presence in Yemen. Security forces in Aleppo have dismantled ISIS cells, freeing a kidnapping victim and arresting members, and Syrian authorities have also arrested four suspects in a separate cell. The Syrian defense minister and a regional commander held talks on security, and Syrian officials discussed climate security and financing on the sidelines of COP31. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/10/world/middleeast/syria-weighs-sending-troops-to-aid-saudi-war-with-houthis.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQdVV2UVNIbUR6RmluYTNfeGNyenZNTlB3cUhTQ0N5UktidTh6VWhuSXJJT0NmTHo3UXJaenppclRJZ0xJLUZfemo3SGI0b0xETVhjTUpMdV9adjBOU0VzS3VfNTRDYU1CRlFpMkpSV3FIcm40YTUxUXN3cTZCTk1GWkl2TmVDX3NSaG1iVWkzMkk2MHZsMWU0WVVxWFBZYTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNLXNycnVSRjdCSmM2QTlSQ3FFcnd0Nnp4MkcxN2RrX1NHeERWVThvSEZyYi1saUlaZWhxNjJUak1RZ3NhdlB4NjN1VGtVdjY4a3lsaDJyVkU3ejEyNzNaTDdLX1Z5YXd4TFNCSS1JaFc2Qy1rVmF0QUVJTUw5Ym1zblpnTWc1UlA3amlyQ1U1TTNINHVUa1FOODdjYmtpTS1vc3h2ZVVVQi1EZzNTUHMwNW5tWHRHdzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera Centre for Studies&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNVzNPVlJPMGxMVEo4VzA4Q2hYTTR2UjdrOEVyazNVeEpVOHpLUzBZNDVpdkoweV9kU09Ob05sWHVfTUhZQ1pRd1B3aVhoSWo4cFh3b2VzUXRwVXZTTktyMDFObmNzcVd1UXJ5VmRDcHAzNTdLTnJqSHphdFNxYUFwazhFYmZEYXgzMTdYQ3FrNWV2aUlBMnl6MUVYdTVDUGd5Z01qdml0UlFHYlJkSTM1SUFOblYwenQxRWhtaUJ4WHk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPcUVMO